// 014.1, 014.3: a parameter is state. An `Amend` installs rule records and leaves state as it is,
// so `Installs { Param … }` would be valid and change nothing; it is refused (CHR037). An
// amendment changes a parameter with `Creates name(value)`.
//! expect-error: CHR037
Param fee = 25
Amend raise
  Installs { Param fee = 50 }
  Holds when True
  Valid when True
.
raise("board").
